"answer": "Project Zenith is an initiative focused on leveraging AI to enhance product offerings, specifically through predictive analytics, data visualization tools, and secure file sharing prototypes. Key developments include the approval of a $2M budget for research, development, and marketing, as well as a separate $15,000 budget for specialized training. The team has expanded with new experts in machine learning and cloud computing. Milestones achieved include the successful testing of the prototype and completion of the testing phase. Current activities involve gathering innovative ideas (with a July 20th deadline), preparing for a staff meeting on November 20th to discuss predictive analytics progress, and seeking stakeholder feedback by the end of November. Celebrations for milestones are scheduled for October 10th."
